     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Bic Ton,<div><br></div><div>Why there is a function named &quot;mean(x,na.rm=T)&quot;? </div><div><br></div><div>Please try:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wGc9nLPQ5AQ/WL4pqKmVyKI/AAAAAAAALRY/-Gn3HArt1DkPBk4pAag28BL_681nB9KDACLcB/s1600/aggregate%2Bmultiple%2Bcolumns.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wGc9nLPQ5AQ/WL4pqKmVyKI/AAAAAAAALRY/-Gn3HArt1DkPBk4pAag28BL_681nB9KDACLcB/s1600/aggregate%252Bmultiple%252Bcolumns.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237776215000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Br4mtFIc83d6AVOu15TKj\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wGc9nLPQ5AQ/WL4pqKmVyKI/AAAAAAAALRY/-Gn3HArt1DkPBk4pAag28BL_681nB9KDACLcB/s400/aggregate%2Bmultiple%2Bcolumns.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"301\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: aggregate multiple columns</div><div># date: 2017.3.7</div><div><br></div><div>res &lt;- read.table(text=&quot;</div><div>avalue bvalue types</div><div>18 8  A</div><div>20 6  B</div><div>52 46 C&quot;, header=TRUE, stringsAsFactors=FALSE)</div><div>res</div><div><br></div><div>test &lt;- read.table(text=&quot;</div><div>types finds</div><div>A 30</div><div>C 40</div><div>B 50&quot;, header=TRUE, stringsAsFactors=FALSE)</div><div>test</div><div><br></div><div>findres &lt;- function(x, y) {</div><div>  # x &lt;- test</div><div>  # y &lt;- res</div><div>  tmp &lt;- merge(x, y, by.x = &quot;types&quot;)</div><div>  tmp$solution &lt;- (tmp$finds - tmp$avalue)/tmp$bvalue</div><div>  return(tmp)</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>findres(test, res)</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><br>bic ton於 2017年3月7日星期二 UTC+8上午1時20分23秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div>I have a table like this (this is just example I have hundreds of lines)</div><div>read.table(&quot;res.txt&quot;)<br></div><div><div>    V1  V2     V3</div><div>1  18  8       A</div><div>2  20  6       B</div><div>3  52  46     C</div><div><br></div><div>and a function like this</div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:rgb(55,55,55)\">fun &lt;- function(x) {</span></i><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(55,55,55)\"><br></span><i><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:rgb(55,55,55)\">x=(x-a)/b</span></i><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(55,55,55)\"><br></span><i><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:rgb(55,55,55)\">res= mean(x,na.rm=T)</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:rgb(55,55,55)\"><br></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#373737\" face=\"inherit, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15.3333px\"><i>and </i></span></font>I have something that changes in my loop called fc</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">now if fc =&quot;A&quot;  excute fun using values:  a from V1 and b from V2  that correspond to A  and the the same for B until no the loop is finished.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Bic</p></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
